drm/client: keep a blanked client's display off on later commits

drm_client_modeset_dpms() turns the CRTCs off, but every later commit of
the client's configuration turns them on again: drm_client_modeset_commit_locked()
always commits with active = true. For fbdev that is the restore on
lastclose (any program that opens and closes the DRM device), on a VT
switch (set_par) and the pan of a scrolling console. fbcon still thinks
the console is blanked, so it does not blank it again, and the display
stays on: scanning out a black console at about 1.5 GB/s, with the
display controller holding CX at SVS_L1 (sunstone, 2026-10-29: opening
and closing /dev/dri/card1 once was enough).

Remember the blank in the client and commit with the CRTCs off while it
lasts. Clients that never call drm_client_modeset_dpms() are unchanged.
Legacy (non-atomic) drivers are left as they were.

Signed-off-by: 14sea <14sea@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_client_modeset.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_client_modeset.c
index 0080a8e95..d231c2689 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_client_modeset.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_client_modeset.c
@@ -1204,7 +1204,7 @@ int drm_client_modeset_commit_locked(struct drm_client_dev *client)
 
 	mutex_lock(&client->modeset_mutex);
 	if (drm_drv_uses_atomic_modeset(dev))
-		ret = drm_client_modeset_commit_atomic(client, true, false);
+		ret = drm_client_modeset_commit_atomic(client, !client->blanked, false);
 	else
 		ret = drm_client_modeset_commit_legacy(client);
 	mutex_unlock(&client->modeset_mutex);
@@ -1282,8 +1282,9 @@ int drm_client_modeset_dpms(struct drm_client_dev *client, int mode)
 		return -EBUSY;
 
 	mutex_lock(&client->modeset_mutex);
+	client->blanked = mode != DRM_MODE_DPMS_ON;
 	if (drm_drv_uses_atomic_modeset(dev))
-		ret = drm_client_modeset_commit_atomic(client, mode == DRM_MODE_DPMS_ON, false);
+		ret = drm_client_modeset_commit_atomic(client, !client->blanked, false);
 	else
 		drm_client_modeset_dpms_legacy(client, mode);
 	mutex_unlock(&client->modeset_mutex);
diff --git a/include/drm/drm_client.h b/include/drm/drm_client.h
index 49a21f3dc..8ae5c104d 100644
--- a/include/drm/drm_client.h
+++ b/include/drm/drm_client.h
@@ -137,6 +137,15 @@ struct drm_client_dev {
 	 */
 	struct drm_mode_set *modesets;
 
+	/**
+	 * @blanked:
+	 *
+	 * The client's display was turned off with drm_client_modeset_dpms().
+	 * Commits of the client's configuration keep the CRTCs off until the
+	 * display is turned on again. Protected by @modeset_mutex.
+	 */
+	bool blanked;
+
 	/**
 	 * @suspended:
 	 *
